# ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# WHAT WE DO TRACK (Unity source)
# Assets/, Packages/, ProjectSettings/ are tracked
# by default since only the above paths are excluded.
# Explicit inclusions for clarity:
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# !Assets/
# !Packages/
# !ProjectSettings/

# Ignore large/source GLB files in repo root; allow the public model asset
*.glb
!bionic-limb-threejs/public/models/*.glb